{"3216800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MÖRK BORG Heresy Supreme", "steam_appid": 3216800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4822150], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/db26127b9bf13df999d13e56264351b7.avif?t=1785246445\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras_big/db26127b9bf13df999d13e56264351b7.avif?t=1785246445 width=1560 height=488 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Big Summer Update in all its misery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Quest and a new colossal Boss. Roam the Dying Lands as a Heretical Priest with an albino monkey with the new playable class. Become a Skelly with the new Arcane Catastrophe. Meet the Dread Risen, hunting you from your very first run. Light on rules, heavy on everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heresy Supreme</strong> revolves around a combat system that is punishing yet rewarding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice must be weighed; react in time or face a violent end. And when weapons are not enough, turn to dozens of items to curse, confuse, and drive your enemies into despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/ac6772ea9551d7f836630e7d4a1b1977.poster.avif?t=1785246445\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/ac6772ea9551d7f836630e7d4a1b1977.webm?t=1785246445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/ac6772ea9551d7f836630e7d4a1b1977.mp4?t=1785246445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Dying Lands</strong> are a place where salvation is always temporary and constantly at risk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a party of wretched antiheroes and try to stall the Apocalypse before they betray you and strip you of what little you have. You can’t win. You can only survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/5e929a7675dd3f7d32c799ae9270a3c9.poster.avif?t=1785246445\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/5e929a7675dd3f7d32c799ae9270a3c9.webm?t=1785246445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/5e929a7675dd3f7d32c799ae9270a3c9.mp4?t=1785246445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A perpetually shifting adventure</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from a large pool of handcrafted situations and quests, constantly rearranged by a semi-procedural system. Enemies, drops, and stats are randomized. Expect no patterns. Expect no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/11d343c4cbd16788a0800ebe80fa62c8.poster.avif?t=1785246445\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/11d343c4cbd16788a0800ebe80fa62c8.webm?t=1785246445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/11d343c4cbd16788a0800ebe80fa62c8.mp4?t=1785246445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mesmerizing art-punk <strong>graphic style</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wretched <strong>world</strong> doomed by an unavoidable apocalypse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brutal, haunting <strong>doom metal soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple classes,</strong> each radically different in strategy, strengths, and approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weird</strong> creatures as <strong>companions</strong> for your cursed walkers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Main Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Short Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Heretic Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Catastrophes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARPG elements</strong>. Light on mechanics, heavy on everything else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Big Summer Update in all its misery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Quest and a new colossal Boss. Roam the Dying Lands as a Heretical Priest with an albino monkey with the new playable class. Become a Skelly with the new Arcane Catastrophe. Meet the Dread Risen, hunting you from your very first run. Light on rules, heavy on everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heresy Supreme</strong> revolves around a combat system that is punishing yet rewarding</h2><p class=\"