 type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A perpetually shifting adventure</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from a large pool of handcrafted situations and quests, constantly rearranged by a semi-procedural system. Enemies, drops, and stats are randomized. Expect no patterns. Expect no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/11d343c4cbd16788a0800ebe80fa62c8.poster.avif?t=1785246445\" width=616 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/11d343c4cbd16788a0800ebe80fa62c8.webm?t=1785246445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216800/extras/11d343c4cbd16788a0800ebe80fa62c8.mp4?t=1785246445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mesmerizing art-punk <strong>graphic style</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wretched <strong>world</strong> doomed by an unavoidable apocalypse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brutal, haunting <strong>doom metal soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple classes,</strong> each radically different in strategy, strengths, and approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weird</strong> creatures as <strong>companions</strong> for your cursed walkers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Main Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Short Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Heretic Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\